{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43304","headline":"舞干羽两阶 · 石倚","name":"舞干羽两阶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"干羽能柔远，前阶舞正陈。\n欲称文德盛，先表乐声新。\n肃肃行初列，森森气益振。\n动容和律吕，变曲静风尘。\n化美超千古，恩波及七旬。\n已知天下服，不独有苗人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"石倚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}